Aim:
To develop a program using functional transformation techniques to increase each employee's salary by 10% and display the updated salaries.
Program:
import java.util.Scanner;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        int n = sc.nextInt();
        int[] salary = new int[n];

        // Read salaries
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            salary[i] = sc.nextInt();
        }

        // Increase each salary by 10%
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            salary[i] = salary[i] + (salary[i] / 10);
        }

        // Print updated salaries
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            System.out.print(salary[i] + " ");
        }
    }
}

